    {
      "id": "claim_eed37ea898af424a9d54e2786431bbe3",
      "statement": "IWB is one of exactly two consumers (alongside the TDIP nightly gpi_tracker_events load) of the GPI_TRACKER_SNAPSHOT Oracle table populated by the Swift gpi Connector (GPI-C) via a 4-hour batch pull from the Swift Tracker API; there is no internal API for gpi status and the snapshot table must not be exposed directly to channels.",
